      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Coelho. Quando Buneary mantém as duas orelhas enroladas, algo está errado ou ele precisa de cuidados. Em batalha, enrola e estende as orelhas para atacar, tornando os golpes mais fortes com o treinamento.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo, Humanoide &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Buneary pode evoluir para Lopunny no nível 8 ou superior quando sua Lealdade for +2 ou maior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Defense Curl, Foresight, Frustration, Pound, Splash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Endure</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Baby-Doll Eyes</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Quick Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Double Kick</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Jump Kick</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Baton Pass</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Agility, Headbutt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Dizzy Punch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>After You, Charm, Entrainment, Flatter</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Bounce</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>17</td><td>Healing Wish</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>After You, Assurance, Attract, Baby-Doll Eyes, Bounce, Charge Beam, Charm, Confide, Covet, Dig, Double Team, Drain Punch, Endeavor, Facade, Fake Tears, Fire Punch, Fling, Focus Punch, Frustration, Grass Knot, Heal Bell, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hyper Voice, Ice Beam, Ice Punch, Iron Tail, Last Resort, Low Kick, Low Sweep, Magic Coat, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Payback, Play Rough, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Retaliate, Return, Rock Smash, Round, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Thunder Punch, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Toxic, Triple Axel, Uproar, Water Pulse, Work Up</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Circle Throw, Copycat, Cosmic Power, Double Hit, Encore, Fake Out, Fake Tears, Fire Punch, Flail, Focus Punch, Ice Punch, Low Kick, Mud Sport, Power-Up Punch, Sky Uppercut, Sweet Kiss, Switcheroo, Teeter Dance, Thunder Punch</p>",
